sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server
    participant H as SignalR

    U->>C: Select + Start
    C->>S: POST duel
    S-->>C: duelId
    C->>H: Join
    S->>H: Status updates
    H->>C: Stream
    C->>C: Navigate Arena
    U->>C: Pick winner
    C->>S: POST verdict
    S->>S: Update ELO
    S-->>C: Done